nftables
kea-dhcp4-server
iproute2
openssl
python3
python3-pip
python3-yaml
tzdata
ca-certificates
openssh-server
sudo
isolinux
syslinux-common
syslinux-utils
# frfw.persistence: sfdisk/partx to add the persistence partition
fdisk
# systemd-logind needs D-Bus: without it the power button does nothing
# (found booting the ISO in QEMU -- an ACPI power-off was ignored)
dbus
# the dnsmasq binary for fr-adblock-dns.service (DNS filtering); -base
# has no dnsmasq.service of its own to fight over port 53
dnsmasq-base
# `wg` for the WireGuard VPN (frfw.wireguard, security-lessons G8); the
# kernel module itself ships with Debian's kernel
wireguard-tools
unattended-upgrades
# The XDP SNI filter (ROADMAP P4-1): `bpftool` loads and pins the
# image's compiled program and its maps (frfw.xdp), and libbpf is what
# the event logger and the TLS fingerprinting reader read its ring
# buffers through (ctypes). Neither was in the image, so the filter could
# not have loaded even with its program compiled.
bpftool
libbpf1
# ROADMAP FND-4: firmware for Realtek NICs (rtl_nic/). Many Realtek
# revisions (RTL8125, the later RTL8168s) need it to work at all, or to
# work properly, and they are the commonest NICs in the homelab boxes
# FR_OS targets. Listed explicitly because live-build's own firmware
# collection is off (auto/config); it is from non-free-firmware, which the
# archive areas already include.
firmware-realtek
